Z||000006||FieroLisa||12-13-2000||10:45 PM||||I remember back in my high school days (ha like 2 years ago) I was dating a guy who had a 20th anniversary edition camaro convertible. Pretty nice car! In any case, his class went on a little all-day field trip and even though we had 2 parking security guards, some crack head (literally) from Akron managed to rip the convert top and start the car with a screw driver and drive away. All between 5th and 6th period. With parking attendants. The car was found about a week or 2 later, front end pretty smashed up and all sorts of drugs hanging around in it. Insurance fixed it,  until he lent the car to a friend and his friend wrecked it again...<BR><P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>86 gold 5 speed SC (For Sale)<BR>Columbus, OH/Greensboro NC<BR>*Lots of New Pics!* <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/</A>||||reg||1
