Z||000023||KevinP||12-14-2000||02:32 PM||||Some bastard try to steal my baby last year.  I was at a gas station filling up, and left the windows down while I went and paid.  I came out, got in and saw a nice chunk missing from my steering column.  The guy at the shop showed me how you can get to the ignition circuits real easy if you bust it in the right place.  I can only imagine if I walked out and saw someone trying to drive my baby away.  Although with my clutch, he probably would never have made it out of the lot!<P>Kevin<BR>'84 SE bumping 800 watts||||reg||9
